                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I visited the new Trillium Young Minds Behavioral Health Center, a Carle Health affiliate. Located at the site of the former Heddington Oaks facility, and scheduled to open in September, this center will dramatically increase the scope of services available to address child and adolescent behavioral health needs. \n\nMy office was proud to secure Community Project Funding in FY22 to help build and expand this larger center to support counseling, mental health, and recovery services.  \n\nI am grateful for all the community stakeholders and advocates who helped make this happen!",
